# DbConn.connect — create_engine argument

In `DbConn.connect`:

- Non-SQLite: `create_engine(self.c_string, **engine_kwargs)` — verbatim URL
  (password and other components unchanged). Enforced by `TestDbConnConnectCString`.
- SQLite: `create_engine(url.render_as_string(hide_password=False), ...)`
  where `url = _sqlite_engine_url(self.c_string)` so shared `file:` URIs get
  `uri=true`. Enforced by `test_shared_file_uri_from_subdirectory`.

Do not use `_c_string_for_log` for `create_engine`.
